# About

I'm Anoop K Chandran, a researcher in the Applied Machine Learning Lab at the
[Jülich Supercomputing Centre](https://www.fz-juelich.de/en/ias/jsc) (JSC),
part of [Forschungszentrum Jülich](https://www.fz-juelich.de/en). 

My code is on [GitHub](https://github.com/anoopkcn).
